        a                              ecrm:E22_Man-Made_Object ;
        rdfs:comment                   "Scarf of embroidered and printed yellow silk crêpe. With a floral design in one corner printed in black. The outlines of some of the flowers and some other details have been embroidered in coloured silks in chain stitch. There is a fringe all round the scarf made from the warp and weft."@en , "Scarf of embroidered and printed yellow silk crêpe, England, ca. 1830."@en ;
        ecrm:P138i_has_representation  <http://data.silknow.org/image/06db55c2-e877-3740-9ebe-f7dba5fd9b0c> ;
